WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:02.888
Turn first-time visitors into regulars.

2
00:00:02.888 --> 00:00:08.100
Everplace by SACKGRAM is a private line between your shop and your customers.

3
00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:15.583
Reaching customers is hard. Many won't give out their phone number.

4
00:00:15.583 --> 00:00:20.870
Ads and delivery apps take a big cut. And social posts get buried in the feed.

5
00:00:26.300 --> 00:00:28.505
Step one: set up your signboard.

6
00:00:28.505 --> 00:00:32.709
Add your name, a line about your shop, your hours and photos.

7
00:00:32.709 --> 00:00:37.970
Pick your metro area, so people nearby can find you. Update it any time.

8
00:00:43.600 --> 00:00:47.069
Step two: put your QR code where customers see it.

9
00:00:47.069 --> 00:00:51.231
On the counter, the window, the menu, or your business card.

10
00:00:51.231 --> 00:00:53.890
One code works for every customer.

11
00:00:58.600 --> 00:01:03.154
Step three: customers scan your code and tap Knock. You tap Approve.

12
00:01:03.154 --> 00:01:06.870
Neither of you needs a phone number or a real name.

13
00:01:11.800 --> 00:01:17.074
Step four: send shop news. It goes only to customers who chose to get it.

14
00:01:17.074 --> 00:01:20.180
Notifications are quiet: no sound, no buzz.

15
00:01:20.180 --> 00:01:24.670
You can send up to five a day, and take one back any time.

16
00:01:30.900 --> 00:01:36.739
Step five: give coupons. Set a welcome coupon for customers who turn on your news.

17
00:01:36.739 --> 00:01:40.869
At the counter, they show a QR code or a six-digit number.

18
00:01:40.869 --> 00:01:44.800
Each code works once, and expires in sixty seconds.

19
00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:55.339
Step six: digital stamp cards. Stamp at the counter, the same way as coupons.

20
00:01:55.339 --> 00:02:01.740
When a customer reaches the goal, the reward arrives on its own. No paper cards to lose.

21
00:02:06.900 --> 00:02:11.559
Step seven: add your staff with a QR code, and set up a counter tablet.

22
00:02:11.559 --> 00:02:17.700
Staff can handle coupons and stamps, but they never see your chats or your customer list.

23
00:02:23.700 --> 00:02:25.550
Your customers stay in control.

24
00:02:25.550 --> 00:02:30.922
They choose whether to get your news, and you see their visit count only if they allow it.

25
00:02:30.922 --> 00:02:33.610
That trust is why they keep coming back.

26
00:02:40.600 --> 00:02:46.931
Open your Everplace. Download SACKGRAM, open the Everplace tab, and create your signboard.

27
00:02:46.931 --> 00:02:51.100
Available in fourteen languages, on iPhone and Android.
